      "start_seconds": 4.49,
      "end_seconds": 7.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "doctor, thank you for seeing us"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.27,
      "end_seconds": 11.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "right, was parking alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.87,
      "end_seconds": 17.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "not great, I ended up a a few streets away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.79,
      "end_seconds": 21.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "what do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 22.43,
      "end_seconds": 27.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "well you know we came cos of not opening my bowels"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.47,
      "end_seconds": 30.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.07,
      "end_seconds": 40.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "I'd say two months. Actually no closer to six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.64,
      "end_seconds": 44.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.7,
      "end_seconds": 50.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Moderate really. I've also had hard small stools."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.1,
      "end_seconds": 55.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "what about a lack of appetite, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.21,
      "end_seconds": 59.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Yes, for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.39,
      "end_seconds": 64.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "what about a bloated tummy, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.23,
      "end_seconds": 68.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "yes, for about three months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.69,
      "end_seconds": 75.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.3,
      "end_seconds": 85.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "I take naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day for the knee pain. Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 89.01,
      "end_seconds": 98.76,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the Thyronorm was 100 micrograms. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.4,
      "end_seconds": 104.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.41,
      "end_seconds": 122.72,
      "duration_seconds": 16.31,
      "text": "not with me i'll bring it next time i take lactulose, 15 ml, at night it's the not knowing that gets to me i'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.67,
      "end_seconds": 141.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.48,
      "end_seconds": 149.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Well my grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.51,
      "end_seconds": 157.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Right tell me about your routine work habits that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.86,
      "end_seconds": 174.69,
      "duration_seconds": 15.83,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I quit smoking around ten years ago. No, I share a house with my brother. I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.45,
      "end_seconds": 180.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.43,
      "end_seconds": 189.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "yes, arthritis in my knees. I've got an underactive thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.6,
      "end_seconds": 200.63,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "right so an underactive thyroid is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.87,
      "end_seconds": 204.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "no I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 205.81,
      "end_seconds": 212.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "I'm not sure that's right. I seem to recall a problem with tramadol"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.99,
      "end_seconds": 218.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Um, maybe, but I don't recall it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.34,
      "end_seconds": 222.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "okay, I'll note both of those"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.64,
      "end_seconds": 235.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "have you noticed black stools, severe abdominal pain or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.8,
      "end_seconds": 239.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.71,
      "end_seconds": 244.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "have you noticed vomiting weight loss or passing wind?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.07,
      "end_seconds": 249.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "no no vomiting weight loss or passing wind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.91,
      "end_seconds": 253.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.87,
      "end_seconds": 256.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.0,
      "end_seconds": 260.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.99,
      "end_seconds": 263.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.9,
      "end_seconds": 267.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.12,
      "end_seconds": 283.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.49,
      "end_seconds": 311.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "okay: saturation 97 percent, temperature 36.9, pulse is 79 beats a minute. And pressure 112 over 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.7,
      "end_seconds": 315.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.83,
      "end_seconds": 318.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "does that that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.45,
      "end_seconds": 336.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "there is firm stool in the left lower abdomen and no mass"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.61,
      "end_seconds": 342.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.98,
      "end_seconds": 386.77,
      "duration_seconds": 27.79,
      "text": "I'm sending you for blood tests because of constipation. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'm sending you for a blood count because of constipation. Let's use macrogol 1 sachet once a day for two weeks. You take it by mouth. It's for constipation. More fibre plenty of water and a regular time on the toilet after breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.3,
      "end_seconds": 397.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.08,
      "end_seconds": 404.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.77,
      "end_seconds": 408.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "So So take care now."
    }
  ]
